# the two data FIFOs' Wishbone side and the master that empties and fills them: OpenCores sd_fifo_filler on the mode clock, with EZ Flash's three-cycle acknowledge; the memories are the BRAMs X3Y1 and X3Y9, the slave the BRAM X3Y5 (a 2 KB buffer the Game Boy bus reads) and the pSRAM path
